flowchart LR
  Publisher[推流端<br/>OBS / WHIP / RTMP]
  Ingest[WHIP 或 RTMP 入口<br/>认证 + 发布注册]
  External[外部拉流<br/>WHEP / RTSP / HTTP-FLV]
  Hub[StreamHub<br/>RTP + remux frame]
  WHEP[WHEP 会话<br/>WebRTC 播放]
  FLV[HTTP-FLV 会话<br/>低延迟]
  Remux[HLS remuxer<br/>分片 + playlist 状态]
  Storage[(HLS 存储<br/>memory / file / S3)]
  Playlist[HLS playlist 路由]
  Segment[HLS segment 路由]
  Viewer[观看客户端]
  Registry[(publisher registry<br/>单机内存 / 集群 Redis)]
  Remote[远端节点<br/>WHEP/HLS/FLV 请求]
  RTPRelay[发布节点<br/>RTP gRPC relay]
  HLSProxy[发布节点<br/>HLS gRPC 代理]

  Publisher --> Ingest --> Hub
  External --> Hub
  Ingest --> Registry
  External --> Registry
  Hub --> WHEP --> Viewer
  Hub --> FLV --> Viewer
  Hub --> Remux --> Storage
  Viewer --> Playlist --> Storage
  Viewer --> Segment --> Storage
  Remote -. 查找 publisher .-> Registry
  Remote -. frame relay .-> Hub
  Remote -. RTP relay .-> RTPRelay
  RTPRelay -. RTP 包 .-> Hub
  Remote -. playlist/segment 代理 .-> HLSProxy
  HLSProxy -. 本地读取 .-> Storage
